paq8px (217-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Package paq8px v217 for the HERMES repository.
  * Built with NATIVECPU=OFF, so the binary runs on any CPU of its
    architecture. HERMES installs used to build it on the station with
    -march=native, which in an emulated image build targets the emulator's
    CPU rather than the Raspberry Pi's.
  * Archives are version-specific: stations exchanging paq8px data (the
    sensor data of hermes-sensors) must all run this version.

 -- Rafael Diniz <rafael@rhizomatica.org>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 23:00:00 +0100
